[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Morale Events"
brief_tooltip = "[Coming Soon]
Low morale (<25%) triggers mental breaks.
Berserk, food binge, or worse."
implemented = false
detailed_text = "[b]Mental Breaks — Coming Soon[/b]

[i]Accounts from the real expedition's final days suggest men broke under the strain — some reportedly turned violent, others wandered off alone. Prolonged starvation, cold, and despair can destroy a man's mind as surely as his body.[/i]

When morale falls dangerously low, a man may snap. The results are unpredictable and always destructive.

• [b]Berserk[/b] — A man lashes out violently at those around him
• [b]Food Binge[/b] — A man devours food stores recklessly, wasting precious supplies
• [b]Wendigo[/b] — In the worst cases, a starving, broken man may kill and eat others

Witnessing death, going hungry, enduring prolonged isolation, and certain personality traits all increase the risk.

[b]Prevention[/b]

Keep morale from collapsing. Shelter, food, companionship, and avoiding unnecessary deaths are your best tools. Once a man breaks, the damage is done."
